        "pkcontributionId": 155983,
        "bookId": 87,
        "chapterId": 285,
        "headingId": 1158,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Superficial FET-ETS family neurocristic tumour is an indolent superficial neoplasm that shares similar fusion events with Ewing sarcoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-31T16:41:39"
      }
    ],
